  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action while entirely within Dim Light or Darkness, you can expend 3 Focus Points to shroud yourself in shadows for 1 minute, until you have the Incapacitated condition, or until you end your turn in Bright Light. While shrouded, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Invisibility.</strong> You have the Invisible condition.</p><p><strong>Partially Incorporeal.</strong> You can move through occupied spaces as if they were Difficult Terrain; if you end your turn in one, you are shunted to the last unoccupied space you were in.</p><p><strong>Shadow Flurry.</strong> You can use your Flurry of Blows without expending any Focus Points.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
